Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神你知道得多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:14.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那鬼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:16.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪只鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:21.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,血雨探花
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花城
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.35,0:02:44.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想知道什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:45.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,尽管问
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:46.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,血雨探花
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.19,0:02:48.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这么了不得的称呼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.65,0:02:49.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到底是怎么来的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:51.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:54.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就有次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.45,0:02:55.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他端了一只鬼的老巢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.99,0:02:58.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走人时见路边有朵花
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:00.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,被漫天血雨打得凄惨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.91,0:03:03.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就偏伞挡了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:12.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这位花城经常到处打架吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:13.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也没经常
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:14.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看心情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.93,0:03:17.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他生前是怎样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:19.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,肯定不是什么好人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:21.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那他长什么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:25.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.11,0:03:27.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他应该长什么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:32.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既是诡王
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.36,0:03:33.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想来形态变化多端
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.78,0:03:35.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有许多模样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:37.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.49,0:03:40.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过偶尔还是会用本相示人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.91,0:03:41.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那我感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:44.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他本相可能是如你一般的少年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:46.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为何
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:48.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你随便说说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.21,0:03:50.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也随便想想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:52.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说不定呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.63,0:03:54.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.55,0:03:55.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他瞎了只眼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:57.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这只
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:02.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这又是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:03.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,问得好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:05.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,很多人都想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.81,0:04:07.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花城是怎么没了右眼的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:08.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说不定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:09.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这就是他的弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:11.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只不过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:12.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是他发疯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:13.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自己挖的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:17.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那花城可有什么弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:18.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,骨灰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.49,0:04:20.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,得其骨灰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.49,0:04:21.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便能驱策此鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.49,0:04:23.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,毁去骨灰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.87,0:04:25.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此鬼便神形俱灭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.71,0:04:29.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,恐怕没人能拿到花城的骨灰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:31.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那不一定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:33.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有种情形
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:35.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼也会主动送出骨灰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:37.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,像他约战三十三神官那样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.43,0:04:39.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当赌注交出去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:42.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:44.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼界有习俗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.56,0:04:47.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若是一只鬼认定了谁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:49.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便会将骨灰托付到那人手里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:52.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原来鬼界还有如此至情至性的习俗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.28,0:04:53.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:55.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是没几个鬼敢做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:57.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若是一片痴心付出
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.91,0:04:59.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,却终遭挫骨扬灰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:01.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那确实令人痛心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.33,0:05:03.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怕什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:04.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.83,0:05:05.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,骨灰送出去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:07.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,管他是挫骨扬灰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:08.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是撒着玩儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:20.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,聊了这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.55,0:05:22.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还不知道这位朋友怎么称呼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.93,0:05:23.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我姓谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:25.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,单名一个怜字
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:26.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.81,0:05:28.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,家中排行老三
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:29.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就叫我三郎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:31.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你走这方向
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.36,0:05:32.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是要去菩荠村
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:34.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我随便瞎溜达
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:36.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,和家里吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:37.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,被赶了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:38.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我饿得不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:40.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以找个地儿歇歇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.41,0:05:45.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:46.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.66,0:05:48.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我还好 不太饿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.79,0:05:49.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也还好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:56.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你一半 我一半吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.89,0:06:04.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:05.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,做什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.56,0:06:07.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,修了个菩荠观 刚开张
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:08.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,菩荠观
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:08.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:09.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.35,0:06:11.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,应该有很多菩荠吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:13.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,来上香 送你吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.73,0:06:14.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那可好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.98,0:06:15.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,供的是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.65,0:06:17.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐太子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.94,0:06:19.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过 你大概不知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:20.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:35.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.92,0:06:37.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:39.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,老黄 走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:41.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走啊 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.24,0:07:05.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有 有鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:06.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,护
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.71,0:07:13.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今天什么日子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:14.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中元
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.13,0:07:18.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,待会儿它们靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:19.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们千万别出声
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:20.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:21.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我恐怕憋不住
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:23.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么办啊 道长
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:24.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也有办法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.43,0:07:25.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,得罪了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:35.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.81,0:07:36.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.73,0:07:37.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,过不去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:42.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的过不去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:43.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,见鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:45.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,能见什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:46.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,咱们自己就是鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:50.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这边可以走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.18,0:08:13.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这位哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:14.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你竟还是一位奇人异士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:16.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说不上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:17.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,略会一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:18.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:19.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:20.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.61,0:08:22.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别怕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:23.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你在我身后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:24.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不会有东西伤得到你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:46.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这个是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.51,0:08:49.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,杀鬼了杀鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.18,0:08:50.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好多鬼火被打散了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:51.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 刚才我们被什么挡住\N- 好多鬼火被打散了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:52.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刚才我们被什么挡住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:53.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,难道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:56.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有和尚道士混进来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:08:56.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在那
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:57.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,坐稳了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.69,0:09:00.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要跑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.11,0:09:05.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:06.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是个道士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.11,0:09:07.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.70,0:09:14.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道长哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:15.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.79,0:09:17.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中元节时段特殊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:18.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,人路鬼路会混在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:20.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,人一旦走到了鬼界地盘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:22.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就再难回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:24.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天官赐福 百无禁忌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:26.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大路朝天各走一边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.01,0:09:27.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第一根左
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:28.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第二根右
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:29.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪路签好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.51,0:09:30.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就走哪边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:41.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们在那 别跑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:42.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我来试试
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:44.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要勉强
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.07,0:09:50.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你运气可真好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:51.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一向如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:52.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们怎么走
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.95,0:09:53.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.87,0:09:54.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既然都是上上签
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:56.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就随便走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:03.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,找到他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:08.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,居然还是选错了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:15.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,冲撞诸位
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:16.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,实非在下本意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:18.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还请诸位高抬贵手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.89,0:10:20.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,高抬贵手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.60,0:10:22.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刚刚打散鬼火的就是你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.19,0:10:23.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,冤枉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.15,0:10:25.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在下只是个收破烂的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.07,0:10:30.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你分明就是个道士
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:31.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,除了道士
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:32.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁还会杀鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:35.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,杀鬼的也不一定是道士啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.08,0:10:37.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那还能是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:37.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:39.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是没可能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:43.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:45.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就接着编吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.55,0:10:48.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今天就让你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:57.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我如何
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:00.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诸位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.77,0:11:02.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:04.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道长哥哥好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:07.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,妖魔鬼怪都被你吓跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:09.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:10.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原来我这么厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:28.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有惊无险
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:30.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟真是上上签之路
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.85,0:11:40.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:41.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:42.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你算过命吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.23,0:11:43.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没算过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.73,0:11:47.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那 你想让我帮你算算吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:48.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.65,0:11:49.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么算
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.61,0:11:50.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看手相如何
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:01.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,寻常妖鬼能化出肉身 装作活人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:02.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但掌纹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.75,0:12:03.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,总会有破绽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:06.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如何
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:09.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你的命格很好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:10.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么个好法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:12.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你性情坚忍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:13.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,极为执着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:14.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,虽遭遇坎坷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:16.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但贵在永远坚守本心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:20.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这少年身上非但没有任何法力波动
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.14,0:12:22.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,掌纹也十分清晰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:24.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,往往逢凶化吉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:26.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,遇难呈祥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.69,0:12:27.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此数福泽绵长
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:28.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.44,0:12:31.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你的未来必然繁花似锦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.32,0:12:32.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,圆满光明
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:35.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若他当真是妖鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:37.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那只有凶以上的境界
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:39.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,才能做到如此滴水不漏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.53,0:12:41.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可诡王又如何会到这种地方来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:43.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:44.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你还想算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:45.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,姻缘
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:49.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想来你应当不愁这个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.75,0:12:51.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想必有许多姑娘喜欢你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.13,0:12:53.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为何这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.05,0:12:55.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你年轻英俊 出身不凡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:57.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,性情豁达 见多识广
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:12:59.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:01.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你这是哄我夸你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:14.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道长哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.53,0:13:15.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多谢你给我算命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.61,0:13:18.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,承你吉言 后会有期
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:23.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎 你今晚住哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:25.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:27.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,睡大街吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.29,0:13:30.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你若不嫌弃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:32.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要不要到我观里来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.38,0:13:33.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:33.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:36.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是我那儿特别简陋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:37.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怕你不习惯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.35,0:13:52.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.28,0:13:56.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.45,0:13:59.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.91,0:14:05.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,妈呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.49,0:14:06.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:07.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:11.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道长 是你救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:13.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今夜之事千万不要说出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:14.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拜托啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.64,0:14:26.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本观危房 诚求善士
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:29.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,捐款修缮 积功累德
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:31.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你看 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.85,0:14:32.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以我方才说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.23,0:14:34.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你可能住不惯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.23,0:14:35.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:37.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对了 有床吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.15,0:14:39.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你若不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.49,0:14:40.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们今晚可以挤一挤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.45,0:14:43.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.21,0:14:52.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.71,0:14:53.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:56.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你这观里是不是少了点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:57.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,除了信徒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.75,0:14:58.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,应当没少什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.30,0:15:00.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神像呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.05,0:15:02.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明天我画一幅像挂上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:04.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,画画我也会啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:05.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:06.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就先谢过你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:08.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:10.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你怕是不会画仙乐太子像吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:12.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我当然会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:14.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,方才我们在车上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.69,0:15:16.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是正说到这位太子殿下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.44,0:15:18.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,莫非你真的知道他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:30.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:32.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.87,0:15:34.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对于这位仙乐太子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.83,0:15:35.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你有什么看法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:41.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:44.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,君吾一定非常讨厌他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:47.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎何出此言
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:49.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不然为何贬他两次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.39,0:15:51.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果然是小孩子想法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:54.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这世上有许多事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:57.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都不能用简单的喜恶来解释
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.32,0:16:00.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,况且
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:02.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,做错了事就该接受惩罚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:06.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君不过是尽了职责而已
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:16.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这个是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:23.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:01.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.70,0:17:30.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.66,0:17:31.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,昨晚休息得可好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.37,0:17:32.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:34.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,观里那画像是你画的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:35.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.37,0:17:37.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,画得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:41.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,能帮上哥哥的忙就好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:47.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你发束睡歪了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:49.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我帮你重新梳一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:01.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一个妖鬼就算再擅长伪装
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.77,0:18:03.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,头发上也会出现破绽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:05.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.61,0:18:07.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有异常
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.45,0:18:13.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:15.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你这是在帮我束发呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:17.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是想做点儿别的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:18.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好了好了 梳好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.91,0:18:21.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我想起来还有别的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:25.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么梳完感觉更歪了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.93,0:18:34.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:35.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.81,0:18:41.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刚换了块门帘准备贴些符
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:45.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.77,0:18:47.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是辟邪符
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.94,0:18:49.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,能屏退邪物入侵
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:52.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既然没有门
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.03,0:18:54.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就用这个先挡一挡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:56.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我离开一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.71,0:19:03.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,难道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.29,0:19:05.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他被符拦在了外面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.49,0:19:38.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.54,0:19:48.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我做个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.81,0:20:01.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既要画符
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.81,0:20:03.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,画在门上岂不更好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:05.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.65,0:20:06.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不是要整修房子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.27,0:20:07.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.15,0:20:09.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,会不会太麻烦你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:11.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥收留我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.98,0:20:13.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我岂能白吃白住
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:36.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没想到你竟然什么都会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.93,0:20:38.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小时候学的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.14,0:20:41.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你家人定待你十分严格
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:43.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:45.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也是小时候刺的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.98,0:20:46.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.06,0:20:48.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你画画得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.65,0:20:49.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也是家中有人教导
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:51.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没人教
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:52.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我自己画着高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.57,0:20:56.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你如何连仙乐太子悦神图都会画
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.41,0:20:58.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不是说我什么都会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.41,0:21:00.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这个当然也会咯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:01.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.87,0:21:04.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:05.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那个大仙是真的特别灵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.62,0:21:06.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 那当然\N- 那个大仙是真的特别灵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.41,0:21:07.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那个大仙是真的特别灵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.37,0:21:09.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大仙在哪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.17,0:21:10.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.13,0:21:10.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,骗人的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.75,0:21:12.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的 我亲眼所见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.80,0:21:15.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,昨儿就是这里的大仙逢凶化吉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.55,0:21:16.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大展神威
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.47,0:21:17.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,震退妖魔鬼怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:19.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这么神通广大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:21.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.39,0:21:22.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,财神大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:23.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,保佑我逢赌必赢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.93,0:21:24.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,月老大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.97,0:21:26.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,保佑我讨到媳妇儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.64,0:21:30.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,送子大仙 保佑我家生个胖娃儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:31.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.27,0:21:32.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.11,0:21:33.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,各位乡亲们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:34.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,请千万不要在此求财
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.40,0:21:34.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 请千万不要在此求财\N- 大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:35.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 后果无法预料\N- 大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:36.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,后果无法预料
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.65,0:21:38.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这里也不管姻缘
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:40.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,更不能保佑生儿育女
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.87,0:21:42.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:44.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,瞧这神像多俊俏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.87,0:21:46.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大仙肯定法力无边
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.00,0:21:48.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 都叫他不要说出去了\N- 一定是个胖娃娃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.71,0:21:50.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:52.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.38,0:21:54.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若能成真我一定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.09,0:21:56.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拜托大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.55,0:21:57.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,香火不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.17,0:22:00.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥 你有好多信徒了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:03.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,正常情况应该十天半月都没人的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.26,0:22:05.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多了信徒 难道不好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:06.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好是好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.10,0:22:08.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是以前没人理
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.56,0:22:09.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,突然来这么多人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.89,0:22:10.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有些不习惯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.48,0:22:13.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想来可能是沾了三郎的运气吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.36,0:22:16.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎 又托你的福了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.44,0:22:17.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谢啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.90,0:22:20.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若我的运气能帮上你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.66,0:22:22.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你全拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.41,0:22:24.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯 你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.33,0:22:25.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.66,0:22:27.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:29.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.58,0:22:31.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.67,0:22:33.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这人不知从哪儿来的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.21,0:22:34.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好像快死啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.59,0:22:36.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大仙你救救他呀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.13,0:22:37.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊 大仙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.47,0:22:45.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道长 道长
